<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00586">
	<title>Increasing set speed</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" outputclass="FormatA" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" height="1.573in" href="../../images/OOV055010.eps" placement="break" width="2.243in"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ul>
								<li>
									<p>Push the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04228"/>) switch up and release it immediately. The set speed will increase by 1 km/h (1 mph) each time the switch is operated in this manner.</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>Push the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04229"/>) switch up and hold it. The set speed will increase by 10 km/h (5 mph) each time the switch is operated in this manner.</p>
									<p>You can increase the set speed to 170 km/h (105 mph).</p>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Check the driving condition before using the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04230"/>) switch. Driving speed may sharply increase when you push up and hold the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04231"/>) switch.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>